<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Crescendo debuts at 6.00 rgt.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Crescendo debuts at 6.00 rgt.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysian property developer Crescendo Corp Bhd debuted on the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange on Tuesday at 6.00 ringgit against an offer price of 4.00 ringgit per share.</p>
<p>The company had offered 27.12 million shares for sale.  </p>
<p>Crescendo is listed on the main board of the exchange.</p>
<p>The company is currently developing a township in southern Johor state, covering 225 hectares.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
